      r3fTechniques: ['drei Text for EXISTS / DOESN\'T EXIST labels', 'Custom superposition oscillation shader', 'Gradient material for spectrum effect', 'Bloom post-processing for glow effects', 'useSpring for balance and dissolution animations'],
